WEBVTT

00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:10.480
Disgaea

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:16.780
Ai no tameiki ni
shibarareteru mitai.

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:21.850
Donna jumon de mo
hodokenai no yo.

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:29.570
Urei wo hisometa
shizuka na hitomi ga...

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:34.800
...yokei ni kokoro
kakimidashiteku.

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:43.350
Sunao ja nai watashi
yori motto...

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:49.580
...sunao ja nai anata
ga itoshii.

00:00:49.690 --> 00:00:55.750
Anata ga ii no,
akuma de mo ii.

00:00:56.330 --> 00:01:02.460
Ah, ima meguriaeta kiseki.

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:08.970
Kienai kizu mo,
fukai karuma mo.

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:12.310
Ah aishitageru,

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:14.810
doko ni ite mo
nando demo.

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:23.450
Aishitageru.

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:38.670
Your squawking is getting
on my nerves!

00:01:39.010 --> 00:01:41.600
I'm gonna shut your mouth with
one swipe of this sword!

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:46.000
Okay, I'm going to
give it every...

00:01:50.150 --> 00:01:52.380
Hey! Are you trying to
mess with my head?

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:54.880
Laharl...

00:01:56.090 --> 00:01:59.920
I guess I really do
need my pendant...

00:02:00.330 --> 00:02:03.190
Please, look for it...
I beg you...

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:08.890
If you find it, I'll give you
something nice to thank you.

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:11.300
"Something nice"
like what?

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:13.630
She's gotta be talking about money,
don'tcha think?

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:15.670
Who are you?!

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:17.270
Hello there, Highness!

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:22.810
I am Etna, the black rose with keen thorns
who serves in the Overlord's Castle.

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:26.280
You don't remember me?

00:02:26.550 --> 00:02:30.460
I remember just fine! What I meant was,
what the hell are you doing here?!

00:02:32.030 --> 00:02:35.650
More importantly, what do we have here?
She's about to croak.

00:02:38.430 --> 00:02:40.090
You're going to
leave her here?

00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:42.790
Forget about her.
We're going back to the castle.

00:02:42.900 --> 00:02:45.300
But she said something
about a reward!

00:02:45.670 --> 00:02:49.510
She's flat broke. She doesn't have
anything to reward us with.

00:02:49.740 --> 00:02:51.470
We wouldn't get anything
for our trouble.

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:53.270
But you're still gonna
leave her lying there, right?

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:56.610
If it was me, I'd blow her to
smithereens right on the spot.

00:02:56.950 --> 00:02:59.580
I never pegged you for having
some kindness in you, Highness.

00:03:03.260 --> 00:03:06.420
Don't you EVER say the word
"kindness" in front of me again!

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:07.680
Roger!

00:03:07.930 --> 00:03:11.020
Anyway, it's her own damn fault for losing
something that was precious to her.

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:14.270
If it's gonna cause trouble if you lose it,
don't carry it around!

00:03:14.730 --> 00:03:16.830
So, what did you lose?

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:21.270
I-I'm just a trainee, so I can't survive
for long in the Netherworld...

00:03:21.370 --> 00:03:25.900
...without the protection of the pendant
that I got from the Seraph.

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:28.310
Gosh, that's too bad.

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:33.210
Get it straight. She mistook me for my
old man and tried to assassinate me.

00:03:33.490 --> 00:03:35.680
Killing her on the spot
is too good for her!

00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:39.450
I'm gonna make her feel the terror
of dying inch by inch!

00:03:39.730 --> 00:03:42.460
Oh, now I get it!
That's my Prince!

00:03:42.560 --> 00:03:44.390
That's so cruel
and heartless!

00:03:45.230 --> 00:03:47.290
- Don't go overboard with the compliments.
- You scoundrel, you!

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:48.990
You're kidding!

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:52.940
Seraph, I'm sorry...

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:59.000
Scratch 1 Mid-Boss,
Add 1 Vassal

00:04:03.450 --> 00:04:05.320
Come on, we're going back
to the Overlord's Castle!

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:06.680
Coming!

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:24.330
Gordon, how does
this look on me?

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:26.570
Wow!

00:04:26.670 --> 00:04:29.140
Now, now, you should
take that off, Jennifer.

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:33.940
The superhero rulebook says that we're
supposed to turn lost items over to the police!

00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:35.950
Oops!

00:04:36.950 --> 00:04:38.440
Oo, that looks good!

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:46.120
CAPTAIN, I HAVE FINISHED BRINGING
ALL SHIP'S SYSTEMS BACK ONLINE.

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:50.090
Give me a minute.
Let me finish eating first.

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:52.490
Hm?

00:04:58.100 --> 00:05:02.040
DANGER! DANGER!
UNKNOWN ENERGY DETECTED!

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:03.430
What?!

00:05:03.540 --> 00:05:05.370
What are you, a demon?!

00:05:07.480 --> 00:05:08.850
Who are you?!

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:11.210
My name...

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:14.720
Oh, I'm terribly sorry.

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:22.460
As I was saying, I am Archangel Vulcanus, and
I have been dispatched here from Celestia!

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:25.760
Those white wings!

00:05:25.930 --> 00:05:27.460
Then you're really
an angel?

00:05:27.570 --> 00:05:28.760
Indeed I am.

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:32.230
YOU HAVE CHEESE
IN YOUR MUSTACHE.

00:05:32.340 --> 00:05:34.000
Oh, thank you.

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:39.070
I had no idea you were an angel!
I have done you a great insult.

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:40.780
Please see fit
to forgive me.

00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:45.370
That is quite all right. We in Celestia are
always watching over you in your struggles.

00:05:45.850 --> 00:05:49.650
Thank you. We are very grateful to
be under the protection of the angels.

00:05:50.090 --> 00:05:54.750
Not at all, it is we
who must thank you.

00:05:55.030 --> 00:05:56.590
How do you mean?

00:05:57.030 --> 00:06:01.330
Miss, might I trouble you
to give me that pendant?

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:08.270
That pendant is a treasure of Celestia
that went missing quite some time ago.

00:06:08.370 --> 00:06:10.930
What? A treasure
of Celestia?

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:12.010
Oh, my!

00:06:12.110 --> 00:06:17.210
It was likely stolen by demons.
Such a horrible deed...

00:06:17.720 --> 00:06:21.380
Still, you are truly the Defender of Earth
to have retrieved it for us.

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:24.020
No, it is Thursday who
deserves the praise.

00:06:24.290 --> 00:06:26.260
He's the one
who found it.

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:28.690
You have my gratitude,
Thursday.

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:30.330
YOU'RE TOO KIND.

00:06:31.230 --> 00:06:32.530
Please, take it.

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:38.430
Thank you,
Defender of Earth!

00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:42.910
Continue your fight against the
demons for the greater good...

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:45.480
...of both the human world
and that of Celestia!

00:06:45.950 --> 00:06:48.380
The heavens expect
great things from you!

00:06:52.650 --> 00:06:54.280
This is wonderful,
Gordon!

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:57.480
We're under the protection
of the angels in our fight!

00:06:58.190 --> 00:06:59.620
I'm all fired up to do
something heroic!

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:01.790
Thursday, we lift off
at once!

00:07:01.930 --> 00:07:04.090
- Punch it, Jennifer!
- Roger!

00:07:14.970 --> 00:07:17.170
I've been looking for you
these past two years.

00:07:17.510 --> 00:07:21.280
Lots of demons think that
you're dead, Highness.

00:07:23.180 --> 00:07:25.010
What were you doing
in that crypt?

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:29.080
That's what I wanna know!
I swear, this is all my old man's fault!

00:07:30.520 --> 00:07:33.650
Chaos brings a smile to the face
of any self-respecting demon.

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:36.290
When you try to stick everybody
with order that nobody wants,

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:38.490
you're gonna end up dying
in a damn stupid way.

00:07:38.800 --> 00:07:42.670
A true Overlord has to be the
foulest, most vicious demon of all!

00:07:43.670 --> 00:07:48.510
So, that's your long, roundabout way of saying
that you're the new Overlord, Highness?

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:51.370
Of course. That's why I'm going
back to the Overlord's Castle...

00:07:51.510 --> 00:07:54.240
...and proclaim myself to be
the best demon for the job!

00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:59.620
And then I'm gonna conquer Celestia and
the human world for messing with me!

00:08:01.320 --> 00:08:04.290
I'm gonna teach 'em who's the most
powerful being in the universe!

00:08:04.390 --> 00:08:07.330
Yeesh! You don't dream small,
do ya?

00:08:07.430 --> 00:08:10.190
Plus, if I go to the
Overlord's Palace,

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:14.530
...I should be able to find out who poisoned me
and tossed me in that garbage dump!

00:08:15.370 --> 00:08:18.460
And when I do...
Oh, the things I'll do to him!

00:08:21.510 --> 00:08:23.840
You're a sharper customer than
I gave you credit for, Highness...

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:27.670
I have to admit, I'm amazed that you managed
to survive in that garbage dump.

00:08:43.230 --> 00:08:44.720
What's the matter?

00:08:45.770 --> 00:08:46.930
I'm hungry.

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:49.630
Etna, make me something
to eat!

00:08:49.740 --> 00:08:51.800
What?! You want me
to cook for you?!

00:08:51.940 --> 00:08:54.740
That's funny, I thought I heard
my vassal talking back to me...

00:08:55.110 --> 00:08:59.340
N-Not to worry, Highness! I found myself some
stalwart allies for occasions such as this!

00:09:02.150 --> 00:09:04.280
Prinny Squad, c'mon over!

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:08.340
Are you joking around?

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:11.520
I said to haul your
feathered fannies over here!

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:23.560
What do you think,
Highness?

00:09:23.670 --> 00:09:27.070
This is the Prinny Squad, a band of
super, all-purpose vassals that I hired!

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:29.800
"Super" all-purpose?
Those clowns?

00:09:33.650 --> 00:09:38.310
You bunch of bozos...
Straighten up!

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:41.750
Prinny Squad reporting
for duty, dood!

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:44.020
See, now we're
in business.

00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:45.520
They don't look
very reliable.

00:09:45.660 --> 00:09:48.320
Who's that kid with the
nasty look in his eye?

00:09:48.590 --> 00:09:52.030
Maybe it's the guy Lady Etna keeps
talking about. You know, the moro...

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:56.090
I couldn't hear what
they were saying.

00:09:56.200 --> 00:10:00.000
He wanted to say, "Goodness, what
a powerful and handsome prince!"

00:10:00.110 --> 00:10:03.470
Honestly, idle chatter like that
can be such a PAIN, can't it?

00:10:04.010 --> 00:10:05.710
Are these guys going
to work out?

00:10:06.050 --> 00:10:08.910
Oh, they'll be fine!
Right?

00:10:09.180 --> 00:10:10.670
Perfectly fine, dood!

00:10:10.850 --> 00:10:15.650
Now that we have that settled, Prinnies, go
make the Prince a meal he'll never forget!

00:10:15.890 --> 00:10:17.410
Aye aye, dood!

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:35.130
Something just buzzed us.

00:10:35.240 --> 00:10:37.140
Those losers came back
for more?

00:10:37.910 --> 00:10:39.840
We've found you,
foul demon!

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:41.310
Hup!

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:45.850
Captain Gordon, Defender of Earth,
has arrived!

00:10:46.350 --> 00:10:48.720
Man, I just can't handle
these types...

00:10:49.090 --> 00:10:51.650
Highness, did you do
something to Earth?

00:10:51.760 --> 00:10:55.060
I have no idea! They're trying to pick
a fight with me for no reason.

00:10:55.290 --> 00:10:57.820
- More importantly, where's my food?!
- So sorry, dood!

00:11:08.610 --> 00:11:13.070
Flonne, I expect you to take responsibility
for failing in your mission.

00:11:15.550 --> 00:11:17.110
It truly is beautiful...

00:11:17.450 --> 00:11:19.610
How could this piece of an
angel's heart that has been...

00:11:19.720 --> 00:11:21.550
...handed down through the ages
in Celestia be anything but?

00:11:21.920 --> 00:11:27.050
Why would the Seraph possibly have given
this pendant to a lowly trainee?

00:11:27.390 --> 00:11:30.020
It is beyond my understanding...

00:11:57.060 --> 00:11:58.960
Disgaea

00:12:00.130 --> 00:12:05.960
Disgaea

00:12:07.600 --> 00:12:08.900
Listen up, demons!

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:13.500
The mere fact that you are demons
makes you a blight on humanity!

00:12:14.010 --> 00:12:16.980
But Gordon, Defender of Earth,
shall mete out your punishment!

00:12:17.280 --> 00:12:19.140
Thursday!
Robo-bazooka!

00:12:19.310 --> 00:12:22.080
ROGER!
CHANGING TO ROBO-BAZOOKA!

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:29.250
Charging energy!

00:12:32.630 --> 00:12:34.180
What do you suppose
that is?

00:12:34.430 --> 00:12:37.730
Beats me. Every spring, we get a lot of
crazies coming out of the woodwork.

00:12:37.830 --> 00:12:39.800
FIRE!

00:12:41.700 --> 00:12:44.330
Berry Barrier Balidaire!

00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:04.680
Our ship!

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:08.890
ABNORMAL OVERHEATING IN ENGINES!
UNABLE TO CONTROL VIA REMOTE!

00:13:19.570 --> 00:13:21.160
Thursday, can you pursue?

00:13:21.310 --> 00:13:23.210
IT'S NO USE.
IT IS TOO LATE.

00:13:23.310 --> 00:13:27.540
What?! All of our household items
are on that ship!

00:13:28.050 --> 00:13:29.110
Let's go after it!

00:13:30.350 --> 00:13:33.580
Prince! Today, we are
forced to withdraw!

00:13:33.690 --> 00:13:38.390
When next we meet, fight fair instead
of using such cowardly tricks!

00:13:38.490 --> 00:13:39.690
Gordon, hurry!

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:41.380
THE SHIP IS GETTING AWAY!

00:13:41.490 --> 00:13:44.090
I can never figure out why those
people do what they do.

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:47.290
Well, that's humans for you.
They're incomprehensible.

00:13:52.240 --> 00:13:53.760
<i>What do you want
this time?</i>

00:13:53.870 --> 00:13:57.570
Laharl, we still have
unfinished business...

00:13:58.080 --> 00:14:00.050
You don't know when
to quit, do you?

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:03.810
Now, now, is that
any way to talk?

00:14:04.350 --> 00:14:07.620
It was the good mademoiselle here
who just saved you.

00:14:07.720 --> 00:14:08.780
"Saved" us?

00:14:08.890 --> 00:14:11.220
Boy, this demon like to
put on airs, doesn't he?

00:14:11.320 --> 00:14:13.660
Mademoiselle, are you unhurt?

00:14:13.930 --> 00:14:14.790
Yes.

00:14:15.430 --> 00:14:20.300
Laharl, I thought I said that
I was going to assassinate you.

00:14:20.870 --> 00:14:23.230
Yeah, whatever! Do us all a favor
and drop dead where you're standing!

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:26.330
I refuse to die. Not until I've
carried out my mission.

00:14:26.440 --> 00:14:29.030
I keep telling you, your
target was my my old man!

00:14:29.140 --> 00:14:32.600
Highness, wouldn't it be faster to just take
her out quick 'n clean and be done with it?

00:14:32.710 --> 00:14:35.740
If you don't do something, she's gonna
turn into a certified stalker!

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:37.610
Yeah, you have
a point.

00:14:40.620 --> 00:14:41.780
Okay, you're on.

00:14:43.460 --> 00:14:45.480
I'll give it everything
I've got!

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:51.820
This is terrible!

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:55.430
Mademoiselle, you mustn't
overexert yourself!

00:14:55.570 --> 00:14:59.130
At the moment, you are in
no condition to fight.

00:14:59.610 --> 00:15:04.240
I shall pitch in and help you, you lovely
angel who sings the praises of love!

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:08.140
Thank you, but this
is my mission...

00:15:08.310 --> 00:15:12.270
Non, non. One must graciously
accept the kindness of others.

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:19.580
And who the hell are you
supposed to be?

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:22.190
Goodness, where are
my manners?

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:26.390
I am the aristocrat who loves beauty
and strength above all else!

00:15:27.100 --> 00:15:29.500
Vyers, the Dark Adonis!

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:35.960
Incidentally, am I to understand that you
are the son of the late King Krichevskoy?

00:15:36.380 --> 00:15:37.210
The very same!

00:15:37.310 --> 00:15:40.570
When they talk about Laharl, heir to the
Netherworld, they're talking about me!

00:15:40.850 --> 00:15:42.870
The Overlord's heir?

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:47.580
Look, the Netherworld is one big
battleground now, where every demon...

00:15:47.690 --> 00:15:50.250
...who calls himself Overlord
is fighting for control.

00:15:50.790 --> 00:15:54.620
If I may be so bold, I, too, am one of those
who is vying for the title of Overlord.

00:15:54.730 --> 00:15:58.390
Somebody who saved the life of an angel
isn't qualified to call himself Overlord!

00:15:59.070 --> 00:16:02.520
You're nothing more than a stepping stone
on my way to the throne!

00:16:03.570 --> 00:16:06.470
Wha...?! Demons of every stripe acknowledge
the superiority of the Dark Adonis, Vy...

00:16:06.570 --> 00:16:11.640
I don't care what you call yourself.
From now on, your name is "Mid-Boss"!

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:15.040
Highness, that's
a great name!

00:16:15.180 --> 00:16:16.510
Nice one, dood!

00:16:17.050 --> 00:16:21.450
M-Mid-Boss, you say?!

00:16:21.550 --> 00:16:23.520
What's the meaning of this?! I'm so angry!
Oops, I think you hurt his ego.

00:16:23.520 --> 00:16:25.150
This is unbelievable!
Oops, I think you hurt his ego.

00:16:25.560 --> 00:16:29.550
This is unforgivable!
You'll pay for this insult!

00:16:30.930 --> 00:16:32.690
You're finally in the mood
to fight, huh?

00:16:40.540 --> 00:16:41.470
What the...?

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:50.570
Oh, my! What a
beautiful pendant!

00:16:51.050 --> 00:16:52.480
What a lucky find!

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:56.510
Surely, it is a present from God to me
for doing a good deed every day!

00:16:56.690 --> 00:16:59.060
What self-respecting demon
thanks God?

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:03.920
Why, this one, of course.
Just take a look at this lovely stone!

00:17:04.300 --> 00:17:08.030
<i>Wow, that really is pretty!
I'd say it'll fetch a pretty penny!</i>

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:12.630
No one is selling this! I found this,
so it belongs to me!

00:17:13.070 --> 00:17:16.670
Please... Please give it
back to me, Mr. Mid-Boss.

00:17:16.810 --> 00:17:20.010
Merde! Et tu, Mademoiselle?
Et tu?

00:17:20.110 --> 00:17:22.410
My name is the Vyers,
the Dark Adonis...

00:17:22.920 --> 00:17:26.480
Mr. Mid boss, I beg you...
I have to have that pendant, or...

00:17:26.720 --> 00:17:28.050
Mr. Mid-Boss...

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:31.180
Looks like that one put him
down for the count.

00:17:31.420 --> 00:17:34.690
So, the pendant belongs
to the angel, huh?

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:37.390
Huh? I don't follow you,
Highness.

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:41.500
Please, Mr. Mid-Boss...
Give it back to me!

00:17:41.600 --> 00:17:46.040
I cannot comply with such a request, not even
at the behest of a lovely mademoiselle.

00:17:46.210 --> 00:17:51.040
As I have said, it was I who found it,
and as such, it belongs to moi!

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:57.080
Wow, he gives you a run for your money in the
"self-centered quibbling" department, Highness!

00:17:57.420 --> 00:18:00.350
Shut up! Don't put me on the
same level as that clown!

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:08.980
Oh, its brilliance grows ever lovelier
each time I gaze upon it!

00:18:09.260 --> 00:18:14.030
No, don't! That pendant punishes
anyone with an impure heart!

00:18:14.970 --> 00:18:17.460
If you don't let go right away,
you'll feel Heaven's wrath!

00:18:19.840 --> 00:18:20.600
Huh?

00:18:20.710 --> 00:18:22.700
What's the deal?
Nothing's happening!

00:18:22.840 --> 00:18:25.830
And after all the self-centered
garbage he spouted, too!

00:18:26.110 --> 00:18:29.340
That's strange...
Maybe it's broken.

00:18:31.680 --> 00:18:33.150
You can't fool me!

00:18:33.490 --> 00:18:36.890
As if pure, righteous, and beautiful moi
would ever be punished by...

00:18:38.390 --> 00:18:41.150
That laugh of yours
rubs me the wrong way.

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:52.560
Just this once, I suppose I'll do as the lovely
mademoiselle asks and let you save face.

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:56.770
Boy, this guy hates to lose.
"Mid-Boss" is a perfect name for him.

00:18:57.240 --> 00:19:02.180
I order you to be silent! You mock
this mid-boss at your own peril!

00:19:02.310 --> 00:19:03.050
Do you hear me?! I won't forgive this!

00:19:03.050 --> 00:19:05.280
Hey, you just admitted to being a mid-boss!
Do you hear me?! I won't forgive this!

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:20.430
Oh, no! We could've made
a mint off that pendant!

00:19:22.230 --> 00:19:23.390
The pendant!

00:19:51.060 --> 00:19:52.620
This is her
"divine punishment"?

00:19:54.200 --> 00:19:55.890
I'd never be able
to touch that.

00:19:56.000 --> 00:19:57.870
I wonder if we could
hold it, dood?

00:19:58.370 --> 00:19:59.930
You definitely couldn't.

00:20:08.880 --> 00:20:10.440
This is what you wanted,
isn't it?

00:20:11.320 --> 00:20:12.650
Laharl?

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:16.150
Hurry up and take it!
Damn thing's hotter'n hell.

00:20:17.160 --> 00:20:18.320
Right!

00:20:26.400 --> 00:20:28.760
Laharl, thank you!

00:20:29.170 --> 00:20:32.800
Cut that out! Words like "Thank you"
make my skin crawl!

00:20:34.910 --> 00:20:40.280
Still, if that was divine punishment, it means
my heart is evil, just the way it should be.

00:20:40.910 --> 00:20:44.540
Laharl, why did you take such a big risk
to give me back my pendant?

00:20:45.120 --> 00:20:48.850
Why else? I did it to get that "something
nice" that you promised me!

00:20:50.020 --> 00:20:52.460
Actually, I've already
given it to you.

00:20:53.660 --> 00:20:55.960
Place your hand
on your chest.

00:20:56.600 --> 00:21:01.970
See? Can you feel it? That warm,
fuzzy feeling in your heart?

00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:09.460
You may say that you're evil,
but there's kindness in your heart.

00:21:13.150 --> 00:21:17.310
The kindness, the love, that's starting
to blossom in your heart...

00:21:17.450 --> 00:21:20.510
Those are the gifts
I gave to you.

00:21:22.090 --> 00:21:25.990
That angel's a real piece of work!
She played this demon for a sucker!

00:21:26.590 --> 00:21:28.690
Etna! Prinny Squad!
Let's go!

00:21:29.030 --> 00:21:31.000
Are you sure that you
wanna leave her here?

00:21:31.130 --> 00:21:32.760
Forget her!
Let's go!

00:21:33.130 --> 00:21:36.190
But you haven't eaten
dessert yet!

00:21:38.240 --> 00:21:40.210
I'm going to come
with you!

00:21:42.410 --> 00:21:45.500
I'm not going to leave your side until
you open your eyes to love!

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:48.840
Suit yourself, Love Freak!

00:21:50.150 --> 00:21:54.280
But if you're gonna tag along for the ride,
you're gonna be my vassal!

00:21:54.920 --> 00:21:58.450
A vassal who's even lower-ranking
than the Prinnies here, got it?!

00:21:59.560 --> 00:22:00.650
Sure!

00:22:01.790 --> 00:22:03.820
This is awesome!
She's a servant, dood!

00:22:03.960 --> 00:22:05.790
Now there's a flunky who's
even lower than us!

00:22:06.300 --> 00:22:08.960
I look forward to working
with you, Prinnies.

00:22:09.470 --> 00:22:11.300
Hooray, dood!

00:22:11.840 --> 00:22:13.830
What's the holdup?!
Get moving!

00:22:13.940 --> 00:22:15.340
C-Coming!

00:22:16.810 --> 00:22:20.470
Um, excuse me? Hello?
Somebody? Anybody?

00:22:20.810 --> 00:22:24.110
Would somebody help...
They're not listening!

00:22:42.070 --> 00:22:49.500
Aoi hiru ga meguru hoshi de
toki no ruupu mezametara,

00:22:49.840 --> 00:22:57.580
chigau kokoro motta mono atsumareba
nanika ga okiru yo.

00:22:57.880 --> 00:23:05.720
Yokubou de umeru no ka?
Ai wa hito no tame ni ugoko no ka?

00:23:05.820 --> 00:23:12.790
Dotchi datte kamawanai yo,
suki ni yaru dake.

00:23:13.470 --> 00:23:21.240
Hikari to kage kono sekai de
subete ga imi aru egoisuto.

00:23:21.340 --> 00:23:29.010
Hitotsu hitotsu no kakera wa
sou baransu wo ninai ikiteru.

00:23:29.150 --> 00:23:40.890
Omou no mama, kokoro no mama ni
ima wa onaji sora no shita...

00:23:40.990 --> 00:23:44.990
...hikari to kage wa kurikaesu.

00:23:45.900 --> 00:23:50.200
Chain react.

00:23:57.440 --> 00:24:00.500
A nameless unexplored region! Hot suspense
on the road that leaves the skin supple!

00:24:00.610 --> 00:24:02.270
The next episode will be
at a hot spring?

00:24:02.380 --> 00:24:04.610
What is it that can be glimpsed through
the steam? Is it love?! Or hate?!

00:24:04.720 --> 00:24:08.740
As the curtain rises on a new tragedy, what
really happened 20 years ago comes to light!

00:24:09.090 --> 00:24:12.020
The remarkable deductive powers of renowned
gal detective Etna shine through!

00:24:12.120 --> 00:24:13.460
Oh, it's a detective story!

00:24:13.560 --> 00:24:17.590
Next time on Disgaea! "Welcome to
the Netherworld Hall of Treasures"!

00:24:17.760 --> 00:24:20.390
You are the culprit! I arrest you
in the name of the Overlord!

00:24:20.500 --> 00:24:21.000
So, who did it?

00:24:21.000 --> 00:24:25.900
Next time:
Welcome to the Netherworld
Hall of Treasures
